       Leaflet gives its own panes z-index 200-700 (markers 600, popups 700).
       The sticky site header is z-index 90. Because .leaflet-container is
       positioned but has z-index:auto it creates NO stacking context, so those
       panes compete with the header directly and win - pins and popups scroll
